  "description": "The RHPv2 (PWP-0222 / PWP-0245) JSON-over-TCP wire codec: 2-byte big-endian length-prefixed framing, the full message catalogue (auth/open/socket/bind/listen/connect/send/sendto/recv/accept/status/close + replies), Latin-1 payload encoding, and type-first dispatch — pinned to live XRouter's wire (capital errCode/errText, the connectReply typo tolerance, string-or-number port normalisation, Latin-1-not-base64 data). The single source of truth for the RHPv2 wire format, shareable by both pdn's RHPv2 server and rhp2lib clients. Source: github.com/packet-net/packet.net.",
